                    "enable_custom_text_color": false,
                    "custom_text_color": "#9e3e3e",
                    "text": "<p>Huusk was born out of a simple belief:&nbsp;</p><p>great hand‑forged kitchen knives should not be reserved only for professional chefs.<br/><br/></p><p>We combine time‑honored forging craft, razor‑sharp high‑carbon steel blades and ergonomic solid‑wood handles, bringing reliable, joyful cutting experience to every home cook, backyard griller and outdoor adventure lover.<br/><br/></p><p>Every Huusk blade carries unique hand‑hammered texture from thousands of hammer strikes.&nbsp;</p><p>No two knives are exactly alike. Whether you are prepping daily family meals,&nbsp;</p><p>getting ready for camp‑fire feasts, or searching for a meaningful gift,&nbsp;</p><p>Huusk turns food prep work into something effortless and satisfying.</p>",
